SELECT 3 FROM [CLASS(MATH 1150), SELECT 1 FROM [SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(BIOL 1010), CLASS(BIOL 1020)], CLASS(EPS 2550), SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(PHYS 1700), CLASS(PHYS 1710)], SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(PHYS 1800), CLASS(PHYS 1810)], SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(PHYS 2000), CLASS(PHYS 2010)]], PLACEMENT("Chemistry Lecture Course")] : "Prerequisites" : 1;
SELECT 3 FROM [SELECT 2 FROM [RANGE(EPS 1000, EPS 1400), RANGE(EPS 1000L, EPS 1400L)], SELECT 1 FROM [CLASS(EPS 2740), CLASS(EPS 2750)], SELECT 1 FROM [CLASS(EPS 2200), CLASS(EPS 2320), CLASS(EPS 2610), CLASS(EPS 3100)]] : "EPS Core Courses" : 2;
SELECT 4 FROM [RANGE(EPS 2000, EPS 9999), RANGE(EPS 2000, EPS 9999), RANGE(EPS 2000, EPS 9999), RANGE(EPS 2000, EPS 9999), PLACEMENT("2000+ Class with DUS Approval"), PLACEMENT("2000+ Class with DUS Approval"), PLACEMENT("2000+ Class with DUS Approval"), PLACEMENT("2000+ Class with DUS Approval")] : "Electives" : 3;
SELECT 1 FROM [CLASS(EPS 4920), SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(EPS 4900), CLASS(EPS 4910)]] : "Senior Requirement" : 1;